  "body": "SPENCER ON BYRON\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in the heart of Takapuna, this spacious one bedroom apartment combines comfort, convenience, and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSituated on Level 2, the apartment enjoys a rare outlook and direct connection to the expansive area surrounding the tennis court, creating a wonderful sense of space that very few apartments in the complex can offer. \r\n\r\nResidents have access to outstanding facilities, including a swimming pool, tennis court, gym, and spa while Takapuna Beach, vibrant cafés, restaurants, shopping, and public transport are all just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a professional, investor, downsizer, or looking for the ultimate lock-and-leave, this is an exceptional opportunity in one of Auckland's most desirable seaside suburbs.\r\n\r\nAvailable furnished or unfurnished, offering the flexibility to move straight in or tailor the space to your own style.",
